<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ФЭС | Дело №2025-0719</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/roboto-mono@latest/cyrillic-400-normal.css');
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/roboto@latest/cyrillic-400-normal.css');
        @import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/roboto@latest/cyrillic-700-normal.css');
        
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            background: #0a0a0f;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        
        .mono { font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace; }
        
        body::after {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 2px, rgba(0,0,0,0.03) 4px);
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 9999;
        }
        
        .screen {
            display: none;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease;
        }
        .screen.active { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
        @keyframes slideUp { from { transform: translateY(30px); opacity: 0; } to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; } }
        @keyframes blink { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0; } }
        @keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 50% { transform: scale(1.05); } }
        @keyframes ripple {
            0% { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0.6; }
            100% { transform: scale(4); opacity: 0; }
        }
        @keyframes shake {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
            25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }
            75% { transform: translateX(5px); }
        }
        @keyframes confettiFall {
            0% { transform: translateY(-10vh) rotate(0deg); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(720deg); opacity: 0; }
        }
        @keyframes wave {
            0% { transform: translateX(0); }
            100% { transform: translateX(33.33%); }
        }
        @keyframes floatIn {
            from { transform: translateY(20px) scale(0.95); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        @keyframes popIn {
            0% { transform: scale(0); opacity: 0; }
            70% { transform: scale(1.1); }
            100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        .progress-container {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 3px; background: #1a1a2a; z-index: 1000;
        }
        .progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c0392b, #e74c3c);
            transition: width 0.5s ease;
            width: 0%;
        }
        .chapter-indicator {
            position: fixed; top: 15px; left: 20px;
            font-size: 10px; color: #444; letter-spacing: 2px; z-index: 1001;
        }
        .transition-overlay {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: #000; z-index: 5000;
            opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.5s;
        }
        .transition-overlay.active { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
        
        .notification {
            position: fixed; top: 20px; right: 20px;
            background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px 20px; z-index: 2000;
            animation: slideUp 0.3s ease; max-width: 300px; display: none;
        }
        .notification.show { display: block; }
        .notification .notif-title { font-size: 11px; color: #c0392b; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .notification .notif-text { font-size: 13px; color: #ccc; }
        
        .btn {
            display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px;
            background: #c0392b; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .btn:hover { background: #e74c3c; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(231,76,60,0.3); }
        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent; border: 1px solid #555; color: #aaa;
        }
        .btn-outline:hover { border-color: #c0392b; color: #fff; background: rgba(192,57,43,0.1); }
        
        #screen-loading { background: #000; }
        .loading-logo { font-size: 14px; color: #666; text-align: center; }
        .loading-logo .title { font-size: 28px; color: #c0392b; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 4px; }
        .loading-bar-container { width: 300px; height: 3px; background: #222; margin-top: 30px; border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; }
        .loading-bar { height: 100%; background: #c0392b; width: 0%; transition: width 0.3s; }
        .loading-text { margin-top: 15px; font-size: 11px; color: #444; }
        
        .case-file {
            background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px; max-width: 600px; width: 100%; position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .case-file::before {
            content: 'СЕКРЕТНО'; position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 20px;
            color: #c0392b; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
            border: 2px solid #c0392b; padding: 4px 12px;
            transform: rotate(-15deg); letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .case-header { border-bottom: 1px solid #333; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .case-number { font-size: 11px; color: #666; letter-spacing: 3px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .case-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
        .case-body p { margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.7; color: #aaa; font-size: 14px; }
        .case-body .highlight { color: #e74c3c; font-weight: 700; }
        
        .witness-card {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;
            background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; max-width: 700px; width: 100%;
        }
        .witness-avatar {
            width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2a2a3a;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .witness-info h3 { font-size: 16px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .witness-info .role { font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
        
        .dialogue-box {
            background: #14141f; border-left: 3px solid #c0392b;
            padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 15px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            max-width: 700px; width: 100%;
        }
        .dialogue-speaker { font-size: 11px; color: #c0392b; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
        .dialogue-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: #ccc; }
        
        .choices { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px; max-width: 700px; width: 100%; }
        .choice-btn {
            padding: 14px 20px; background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 6px; color: #ccc; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s; text-align: left; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }
        .choice-btn:hover { border-color: #c0392b; background: rgba(192,57,43,0.1); color: #fff; transform: translateX(5px); }
        .choice-btn.correct { border-color: #27ae60; background: rgba(39,174,96,0.15); color: #27ae60; pointer-events: none; }
        .choice-btn.wrong { border-color: #e74c3c; background: rgba(231,76,60,0.1); animation: shake 0.5s; }
        
        .evidence-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px; max-width: 500px; width: 100%;
        }
        .evidence-item {
            aspect-ratio: 1; background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 32px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .evidence-item:hover { border-color: #c0392b; transform: scale(1.05); }
        .evidence-item.found { border-color: #27ae60; background: rgba(39,174,96,0.1); }
        .evidence-item.found::after {
            content: '✓'; position: absolute; top: 5px; right: 8px;
            color: #27ae60; font-size: 14px;
        }
        .evidence-counter { text-align: center; color: #888; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .evidence-counter span { color: #c0392b; font-weight: 700; }
        
        .city-map {
            max-width: 600px; width: 100%;
            background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px; text-align: center;
        }
        .city-map h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .city-map .clue { color: #f39c12; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic; }
        .city-buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .city-btn {
            padding: 10px 20px; background: #2a2a3a; border: 1px solid #444;
            border-radius: 20px; color: #ccc; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }
        .city-btn:hover { border-color: #c0392b; color: #fff; background: rgba(192,57,43,0.15); }
        .city-btn.rejected {
            border-color: #e74c3c; color: #e74c3c; opacity: 0.5;
            text-decoration: line-through; pointer-events: none;
        }
        .city-result {
            min-height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px; color: #888;
        }
        
        .surv-map {
            background: #111; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            height: 350px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 20px; max-width: 700px; width: 100%;
        }
        .map-grid {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background-image:
                linear-gradient(rgba(50,50,50,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(50,50,50,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 30px 30px;
        }
        .map-target {
            position: absolute; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 20px;
        }
        .map-target::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid #c0392b;
            animation: ripple 2s infinite;
        }
        .map-target:hover { transform: scale(1.3); }
        .surv-log {
            background: #14141f; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 15px; max-height: 150px; overflow-y: auto; max-width: 700px; width: 100%;
        }
        .log-entry { font-size: 12px; color: #888; padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a2a; animation: slideUp 0.3s ease; }
        .log-entry .time { color: #555; margin-right: 10px; }
        .log-entry.alert { color: #e74c3c; }
        .log-entry.success { color: #27ae60; }
        .rec-indicator { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #e74c3c; letter-spacing: 2px; }
        .rec-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: #e74c3c; border-radius: 50%; animation: blink 1s infinite; }
        
        .expertise-panel {
            max-width: 600px; width: 100%; background: #1c1c28;
            border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px;
        }
        .expertise-header {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
        }
        .expertise-icon { font-size: 28px; }
        .expertise-header h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 18px; }
        .lab-tag {
            font-size: 10px; color: #27ae60; background: rgba(39,174,96,0.1);
            padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 3px; margin-left: auto; letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .memory-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 10px; max-width: 400px; width: 100%; margin: 20px auto;
        }
        .memory-card {
            aspect-ratio: 1; background: #2a2a3a; border: 2px solid #444;
            border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 28px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; user-select: none;
        }
        .memory-card:hover { border-color: #c0392b; }
        .memory-card.flipped { background: #1c1c28; border-color: #f39c12; }
        .memory-card.matched { background: rgba(39,174,96,0.15); border-color: #27ae60; }
        .memory-card .card-face { display: none; }
        .memory-card.flipped .card-face, .memory-card.matched .card-face { display: block; }
        .memory-card .card-back { display: block; font-size: 20px; color: #555; }
        .memory-card.flipped .card-back, .memory-card.matched .card-back { display: none; }
        
        .timeline { max-width: 600px; width: 100%; position: relative; padding-left: 30px; }
        .timeline::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 0; bottom: 0;
            width: 2px; background: #333;
        }
        .timeline-item {
            position: relative; margin-bottom: 25px; padding: 15px;
            background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            animation: floatIn 0.5s ease; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        .timeline-item:hover { border-color: #c0392b; }
        .timeline-item::before {
            content: ''; position: absolute; left: -25px; top: 20px;
            width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #c0392b;
            border: 2px solid #0a0a0f;
        }
        .timeline-item.resolved::before { background: #27ae60; }
        .timeline-item .tl-time { font-size: 11px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .timeline-item .tl-text { font-size: 14px; color: #ccc; }
        
        .code-display {
            background: #0a0a0f; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .code-chars { font-size: 32px; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #c0392b; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .code-hint { font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
        .code-input-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .code-input {
            width: 45px; height: 50px; background: #0a0a0f; border: 2px solid #444;
            border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; font-size: 22px; text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Roboto Mono', monospace; transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }
        .code-input:focus { border-color: #c0392b; outline: none; }
        .code-input.correct-char { border-color: #27ae60; color: #27ae60; }
        
        .chat-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin: 20px 0; width: 100%; max-width: 500px; }
        .phone-message { padding: 15px; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 400px; animation: floatIn 0.3s ease; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .phone-message.incoming { background: #2a2a3a; border-radius: 12px 12px 12px 2px; align-self: flex-start; }
        .phone-message.outgoing { background: rgba(192,57,43,0.2); border: 1px solid rgba(192,57,43,0.3); border-radius: 12px 12px 2px 12px; align-self: flex-end; }
        
        .final-container { max-width: 650px; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
        .case-closed { font-size: 12px; color: #27ae60; letter-spacing: 4px; margin-bottom: 15px; animation: slideUp 0.5s ease; }
        .final-title { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 30px; animation: slideUp 0.5s ease 0.2s both; }
        .final-letter {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 12px; padding: 30px; margin-bottom: 30px;
            animation: slideUp 0.5s ease 0.4s both; text-align: left;
        }
        .final-letter p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #ccc; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .final-letter .big-text { font-size: 24px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .final-letter .sup-emoji { font-size: 48px; display: block; margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; }
        .final-invitation { animation: slideUp 0.5s ease 0.6s both; }
        .final-invitation .question { font-size: 22px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 25px; font-weight: 700; }
        .final-buttons { display: flex; gap: 15px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .btn-yes {
            padding: 16px 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27ae60, #2ecc71);
            color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }
        .btn-yes:hover { transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(39,174,96,0.4); }
        .btn-no {
            padding: 16px 40px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #555;
            color: #888; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 18px; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }
        
        .celebration-emoji { font-size: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .celebration-text { font-size: 28px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .celebration-sub { font-size: 16px; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; }
        .confetti {
            position: fixed; width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 2px;
            animation: confettiFall linear forwards; z-index: 9998;
        }
        
        .water-bg {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 200px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(52,152,219,0.1)); overflow: hidden;
        }
        .wave {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: -100%; width: 300%; height: 60px;
            background: rgba(52,152,219,0.08); border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
            animation: wave 8s linear infinite;
        }
        .wave:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: -2s; height: 40px; background: rgba(52,152,219,0.05); }
        
        .section-title { font-size: 12px; color: #666; letter-spacing: 3px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; }
        .section-subtitle { font-size: 20px; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center; }
        
        .interrogation-room { max-width: 700px; width: 100%; }
        
        .odd-game {
            max-width: 600px; width: 100%;
            background: #1c1c28; border: 1px solid #333; border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .odd-round-indicator {
            text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666;
            letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .odd-round-indicator span { color: #c0392b; font-weight: 700; }
        .odd-question {
            text-align: center; color: #aaa; font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic;
        }
        .odd-items {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .odd-item {
            background: #2a2a3a; border: 2px solid #444;
            border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px 15px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
            gap: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .odd-item:hover {
            border-color: #c0392b; background: #333;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
        }
        .odd-item .odd-emoji { font-size: 40px; }
        .odd-item .odd-label { font-size: 13px; color: #ccc; }
        .odd-item.correct-pick {
            border-color: #27ae60; background: rgba(39,174,96,0.15);
            animation: popIn 0.4s ease;
        }
        .odd-item.wrong-pick {
            border-color: #e74c3c; background: rgba(231,76,60,0.1);
            animation: shake 0.5s;
        }
        .odd-feedback {
            text-align: center; min-height: 40px;
            font-size: 14px; color: #888;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .evidence-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
            .case-file { padding: 25px; }
            .final-title { font-size: 24px; }
            .code-chars { font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 4px; }
            .memory-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
            .odd-items { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="progress-container"><div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div></div>
    <div class="chapter-indicator" id="chapterIndicator"></div>
    <div class="transition-overlay" id="transitionOverlay"></div>
    <div class="notification" id="notification">
        <div class="notif-title">УВЕДОМЛЕНИЕ</div>
        <div class="notif-text" id="notifText"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 0: LOADING -->
    <div class="screen active" id="screen-loading">
        <div class="loading-logo">
            <div class="title">С Л Е Д</div>
            <div>Федеральная Экспертная Служба</div>
            <div style="margin-top:5px; font-size:10px; color:#444;">Система управления делами | Версия 4.7.2 | ДСП</div>
            <div class="loading-bar-container">
                <div class="loading-bar" id="loadingBar"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="loading-text" id="loadingText">Инициализация системы...</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1: BRIEFING -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-briefing">
        <div class="case-file">
            <div class="case-header">
                <div class="case-number mono">ДЕЛО № 2025-0719-Х</div>
                <div class="case-title">Загадка пропавших выходных</div>
            </div>
            <div class="case-body">
                <p>Следователь, у нас необычное дело. Поступил сигнал: кто-то <span class="highlight">запланировал нечто на ближайшие выходные</span>, но скрывает это.</p>
